Package: zufapmx
Title: Read, Write and Check Equivalence of Pharmacometric Models
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Pedro", "Baltazar", , "pedrobtz@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Holds a population pharmacokinetic and pharmacodynamic model
    as one R object, reads it from 'NONMEM' control streams, 'rxode2' and
    'nlmixr2' model functions and 'mrgsolve' model specifications, and
    writes it to any of them, reporting what a translation keeps and what
    it loses. Checks that two models are the same model by simulating both
    on a canonical design, each through its own engine, and comparing the
    predictions against a tolerance.
